  "title": "Sasanian Empire",
  "summary": "The Sasanian Empire was the Persian dynasty that ruled from 224 to 651. Ardashir I founded it by defeating the last Parthian king, and its kings were inaugurated at Ctesiphon, the capital. The dynasty ended when Yazdegerd III lost a long struggle against Arab invaders.",
